{
  "id": "family-grocery-list",
  "title": "和家人列採買清單",
  "titleEn": "Making a Family Grocery List",
  "category": "居家日常",
  "level": "初級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/family-grocery-list.webp",
    "alt": "在溫馨明朗的廚房裡，媽媽和小男孩圍坐在木質餐桌前，媽媽手拿鉛筆在筆記本上寫下採買項目，小男孩專注地看著打開的冰箱確認食材。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "On Saturday morning, Ben and his mom sit at the "
        },
        {
          "text": "kitchen",
          "wordIds": [
            "kitchen"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " table."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "星期六早晨，Ben 和媽媽坐在廚房的餐桌旁。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-grocery-list/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "a849b363d26f22d4226de4fd54cdff8b8f67b12068030933d040d10cc71bf6bb",
        "sha256": "3eb5583050ae7040b493722a586ea9f7c286c6df0678603458bf52ab1888aaab"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom looks up from the table and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's check the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-check-the-fridge"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fridge",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-check-the-fridge"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "fridge"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-check-the-fridge"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽從餐桌抬起頭說：「我們來檢查一下冰箱吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-grocery-list/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "e783d5cecf5dee798bb517152e59fa93cf5d6378de072a2d61d99fa79f3f2bed",
        "sha256": "c7e7cd334522a8576d0562af7a49b3fd12486f3a4349c56e06d715baa747969b"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben opens the door, looks inside, and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do we need any ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "do-we-need-any-eggs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eggs",
          "phraseIds": [
            "do-we-need-any-eggs"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "eggs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "do-we-need-any-eggs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 打開冰箱門看著裡面，問道：「我們需要雞蛋嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-grocery-list/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "5a407597fc7a69521821f13b41c5c1f86a8e92487f6655b54f0890888ad51c98",
        "sha256": "e66fe590d58e769b4acc5d85ca7ea22e0e8c1144a8470db51d897c10c938274a"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom looks at the empty egg carton and says, “Yes, and we also need fresh "
        },
        {
          "text": "milk",
          "wordIds": [
            "milk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽看著空蛋盒並說：「對，而且我們也需要新鮮的牛奶。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-grocery-list/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "78fa1860201b7325d5886cc21167da546eb38f9392a0707afbb0399fc0bbc6a8",
        "sha256": "4fa10455936880e9bfa9c343f3bd9ed7516eff666450a0a7771aa57c1591cd9d"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben holds the pencil ready, and Mom says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Write it on the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "write-it-on-the-list"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "list",
          "phraseIds": [
            "write-it-on-the-list"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "list"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "write-it-on-the-list"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 拿好鉛筆準備記錄，媽媽說：「把它寫在清單上吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-grocery-list/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "075bf07951da25fa9c50e8fca57468bf2d7e0f307a2041cd457b868be8fdf024",
        "sha256": "571be64b31b9692bb2939c5580413a8b74c97fac844b37b1af6c481c5799ba87"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "With their shopping items written down for the "
        },
        {
          "text": "market",
          "wordIds": [
            "market"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Mom smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "We are ready to go.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-are-ready-to-go"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "把去市場要買的東西都寫好後，媽媽微笑著說：「我們準備好出發了。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/family-grocery-list/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "683f8e6c94415f0574f98e730b32c35197c1f0f1f3ea22c1c398abdb98db72a8",
        "sha256": "f0304742adeedcd7f3b03523bcaecdd7f92c994f5600700de9e329cb49895cda"
      }
    }
  ],
